target/
# Written by `sv_codegen::generate_icd_entry` only when a generated section does
# not parse, so that a person has the offending tokens to read. Never useful
# checked in.
sv-icd-entry-unparsed.rs
result
result-*
.direnv/
# DXVK writes its pipeline state cache next to the *working directory* rather
# than next to the .exe, so `scripts/sv-dxvk-d3d11.sh` run from the repo root
# leaves one here.
*.dxvk-cache
# Wine prefixes are disposable and enormous; the shellHook puts them under /tmp
# but a stray WINEPREFIX=. would otherwise drop one here.
.wine/
*.exe.so
shadercache.bin

# stray Firefox MOZ_LOG output from a probe run
.child-*.moz_log
# kache: the config is regenerated on every `nix develop`, the store is huge.
.kache.toml
.kache-store/
# worktrees live inside the project so they share the kache store above
.claude/worktrees/
